sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Client
  participant Gateway
  participant Identity
  participant Policy
  participant Service
  Client->>Gateway: Request to public route
  Gateway->>Gateway: Validate framing and limits
  Gateway->>Gateway: Resolve registered route
  Gateway->>Identity: Verify credential when required
  Identity-->>Gateway: Verified principal or rejection
  Gateway->>Policy: Evaluate permission and quota
  Policy-->>Gateway: Allow or deny
  alt Allowed
    Gateway->>Service: Forward filtered request with deadline
    Service-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway->>Gateway: Normalize response and headers
    Gateway-->>Client: Public response and correlation ID
  else Denied
    Gateway-->>Client: Safe 401, 403 or 429 error
  end
